                                                "sense_id": "59625b63-f058-3fd8-9a98-dd91b35fe3ae",
                                                "text": "We […] generally identify a film on the basis of a videogram and audiogram that does not necessarily use the voices of the actors; in other words, a film that has been dubbed or subtitled remains for us the same film (and not an adaptation or a new version of the original film) […]"
